          "oneLine": "本文研究 The realization of intrinsic, tunable high-frequency quantum states without external radiation is a major goal in condensed matter physics and quantum device engineering。",
          "problem": "这篇论文关注：The realization of intrinsic, tunable high-frequency quantum states without external radiation is a major goal in condensed matter physics and quantum device engineering？",
          "result": "结果表明，a uniformly sliding charge-density wave (CDW) acts as an intrinsic dc-to-ac converter, transforming spatial periodicity into temporal periodicity to realize a unique periodically driven quantum。",
